I obtain no \(N^{1/6+o(1)}\) algorithm covering every band \(R\le N^\theta\) for fixed \(\theta>0\). There is, however, a useful extraction improvement: standard collision recovery, combined with the 2026 Harvey–Hittmeir order theorem and seven prime blocks, removes the order exception entirely.

